{"name":"The Opener Lamp","slug":"glyph-opener-lamp","blurb":"On the veto street, Uma carries the lamp toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Opener. Click the lamp and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Opener Lamp.","seal":"5224cb09ac9fcbd8eca5cee1cb695d5fe99d5fccdf5279633c6e09f9f4031d71"}
